#. ja: トリテレイアの種
#. de: Beutel[p] Triteleia-Samen
#. fr: poignée de graines de triteleia
#. column 2: bags of triteleia seeds
#. column 8: The triteleia is also known as the triplet lily─as the various parts of the flower come in threes─care has been taken to ensure the number of seeds is divisible by three, so as not to ruin the pattern. After all, “three is the mandatory number,” as the saying probably goes.<br><br>※For use in planters.
#. column 9: Triteleia Seeds
msgctxt "Item:35744:0:0"
msgid "bag of triteleia seeds"
msgstr "Пакетик семян трителеи"

#. de: Beutel[p] Triteleia-Samen
#. fr: poignées de graines de triteleia
#. column 0: bag of triteleia seeds
#. column 8: The triteleia is also known as the triplet lily─as the various parts of the flower come in threes─care has been taken to ensure the number of seeds is divisible by three, so as not to ruin the pattern. After all, “three is the mandatory number,” as the saying probably goes.<br><br>※For use in planters.
#. column 9: Triteleia Seeds
msgctxt "Item:35744:0:2"
msgid "bags of triteleia seeds"
msgstr "Пакетики семян трителеи"

#. ja: 栽培用のトリテレイアの種<br>[植木鉢専用]
#. de: Samen zum Anbau von Triteleia. Zur Anpflanzung in einem Blumentopf.
#. fr: Ces graines servent à faire pousser des triteleia.<br>[Réservé aux pots de fleurs]
#. column 0: bag of triteleia seeds
#. column 2: bags of triteleia seeds
#. column 9: Triteleia Seeds
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:35744:0:8"
msgid "The triteleia is also known as the triplet lily─as the various parts of the flower come in threes─care has been taken to ensure the number of seeds is divisible by three, so as not to ruin the pattern. After all, “three is the mandatory number,” as the saying probably goes.<br><br>※For use in planters."
msgstr "Трителею также называют тройной лилией: все части цветка состоят из трёх элементов. Чтобы не нарушать этот порядок, количество семян в пакетике кратно трём. Ведь, как говорится, «три — обязательное число».<br><br>※Используется в цветочных горшках."

#. ja: トリテレイアの種
