#. column 8: A stunning but sadly unstoried blade recovered from Pandæmonium. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Unsung Blade of Asphodelos
msgctxt "Item:35827:0:0"
msgid "unsung blade of Asphodelos"
msgstr "не воспетый клинок Асфоделоса"

