msgstr "Не воспетый клинок Асфоделоса"

#. ja: 星戦の強化薬
#. de: Fläschchen[p] Himmelsheer-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant de l'Ost rayonnant
#. column 2: flasks of Radiant roborant
#. column 8: A translucent substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya, used to enhance the properties of weapons borne by the Radiant Host. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Radiant Roborant
msgctxt "Item:35828:0:0"
msgid "flask of Radiant roborant"
msgstr "флакон усиливающего состава Светоносного воинства"

#. de: Fläschchen[p] Himmelsheer-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fioles d'agent renforçant de l'Ost rayonnant
#. column 0: flask of Radiant roborant
